This repository is provided as a public reproducibility package for nonlinear
trimmed and multipatch shell isogeometric analysis. It includes selected
numerical data, CAD and finite-element input models, benchmark source files,
and a packaged AutoCAD/ObjectARX runtime build.

No open-source license is granted for copying, redistribution, modification,
commercial use, or incorporation into other software unless separate written
permission is obtained from the copyright holders.

The complete AutoCAD/ObjectARX C++ implementation is not included in this
repository and is available only from the corresponding author upon reasonable
request, subject to project, dependency, third-party runtime, and CAD-kernel
licensing constraints.
